Source: kuickshare
Section: net
Priority: optional
Maintainer: KuickShare Developers <the-beper@users.noreply.github.com>
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Build-Depends: cargo, cmake, debhelper-compat (= 13), extra-cmake-modules,
 gettext, g++, libdbus-1-dev, libkf6coreaddons-dev, libkf6crash-dev,
 libkf6dbusaddons-dev, libkf6i18n-dev, libkf6jobwidgets-dev,
 libkf6notifications-dev, libkf6statusnotifieritem-dev, libkirigami-dev,
 ninja-build, pkg-config, protobuf-compiler, qt6-base-dev, qt6-declarative-dev, rustc

Package: kuickshare
Architecture: amd64
Depends: dbus, qml6-module-org-kde-desktop, qml6-module-org-kde-kirigami,
 qml6-module-org-kde-kirigamiaddons-formcard, qml6-module-org-kde-ki18n,
 qml6-module-qtqml-workerscript, qml6-module-qtquick,
 qml6-module-qtquick-controls, qml6-module-qtquick-dialogs,
 qml6-module-qtquick-layouts, qml6-module-qtquick-shapes,
 qml6-module-qtquick-templates, qml6-module-qtquick-window, qt6-svg-plugins,
 ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: Share files between devices on the same network
 Nothing to configure: transfer with a click or drag and drop, over Wi-Fi or Wi-Fi Direct.
 .
 Built against the Qt 6 of Ubuntu 26.04 (resolute): the *runtime* QML module set
 (the Depends above) is proven by build/packaging/test-deb.sh in a bare container.
